# Keep the image small and deterministic: never bake secrets, the virtualenv,
# local uploads, or build output into the context.
.git
.gitignore
Docs
*.pdf
VendorPulse Backend Walkthrough*.html

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
Backend/venv
Backend/media
Backend/staticfiles
Backend/spa
Backend/db.sqlite3
Backend/.env

frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/.vite

deploy/*.md
